# STEP 2 — SIMULATOR → TRAJECTORY / OBSERVABLE AUDIT
#
# PURPOSE:
#   1. Inspect exact simulator API
#   2. Generate one trajectory per regime
#   3. Verify timestep alignment
#   4. Build Information-State R(t)
#   5. Measure its temporal evolution
