# ============================================================
# STEP 10 — FNO BASELINE PROTOTYPE TRAINING
#
# SAME:
#   Dataset V3
#   Train / Val / Test split
#   Input representation
#   Environment conditioning
#   Target
#
# PURPOSE:
#   Establish a fair, properly trained FNO baseline.
#
# INPUT:
#   R(t), amplitude(t), gamma, noise_sigma
#
# TARGET:
#   R(t+1), amplitude(t+1)
